      "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14",
      "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nGiven any glueing data of locally ringed spaces there\nexists a locally ringed space <MATH_0001> and open subspaces\n<MATH_0002> together with isomorphisms\n<MATH_0003> of locally ringed spaces such that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nThe locally ringed space <MATH_0007> is characterized by the following\nmapping properties: Given a locally ringed space <MATH_0008> we have\n<MATHSEG_0001>open covering <MATHSEG_0002> and <MATHSEG_0003> such that<MATHSEG_0004> and <MATHSEG_0005>\n",
      "source_status": "CURRENT",
      "placeholders": {
        "LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nIf you have two locally ringed spaces, and a subspace of the first one\nis isomorphic to a subspace of the other, then you can glue them together\ninto one big locally ringed space.\n\\end{slogan}",
        "MATH_0001": "$X$",
        "MATH_0002": "$U_i \\subset X$",
        "MATH_0003": "$\\varphi_i : X_i \\to U_i$",
        "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}",
        "STRUCT_0002": "\\item",
        "MATH_0004": "$X=\\bigcup_{i\\in I} U_i$",
        "STRUCT_0003": "\\item",
        "MATH_0005": "$\\varphi_i(U_{ij}) = U_i \\cap U_j$",
        "STRUCT_0004": "\\item",
        "MATH_0006": "$\\varphi_{ij} =\n\\varphi_j^{-1}|_{U_i \\cap U_j} \\circ \\varphi_i|_{U_{ij}}$",
        "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}",
        "MATH_0007": "$X$",
        "MATH_0008": "$Y$",
        "MATHSEG_0001": "\\begin{eqnarray*}\n\\Mor(X, Y) & = & \\{ (f_i)_{i\\in I} \\mid\nf_i : X_i \\to Y, \\ f_j \\circ \\varphi_{ij} = f_i|_{U_{ij}}\\} \\\\\nf & \\mapsto & (f|_{U_i} \\circ \\varphi_i)_{i \\in I} \\\\\n\\Mor(Y, X) & = &\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{",
        "MATHSEG_0002": "}Y = \\bigcup\\nolimits_{i \\in I} V_i\\text{",
        "MATHSEG_0003": "}\n(g_i : V_i \\to X_i)_{i \\in I}\n\\text{",
        "MATHSEG_0004": "}\\\\\ng_i^{-1}(U_{ij}) = V_i \\cap V_j\n\\text{",
        "MATHSEG_0005": "}\ng_j|_{V_i \\cap V_j} = \\varphi_{ij} \\circ g_i|_{V_i \\cap V_j}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\} \\\\\ng & \\mapsto &\nV_i = g^{-1}(U_i), \\ g_i = \\varphi_i^{-1} \\circ g|_{V_i}\n\\end{eqnarray*}"
      },
      "render": {
        "prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-glue}\n",
        "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"
      },
      "math_text_regions": [
        {
          "region_id": "math/0001",
          "delimiter_kind": "environment",
          "source": "\\begin{eqnarray*}\n\\Mor(X, Y) & = & \\{ (f_i)_{i\\in I} \\mid\nf_i : X_i \\to Y, \\ f_j \\circ \\varphi_{ij} = f_i|_{U_{ij}}\\} \\\\\nf & \\mapsto & (f|_{U_i} \\circ \\varphi_i)_{i \\in I} \\\\\n\\Mor(Y, X) & = &\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{open covering }Y = \\bigcup\\nolimits_{i \\in I} V_i\\text{ and }\n(g_i : V_i \\to X_i)_{i \\in I}\n\\text{ such that}\\\\\ng_i^{-1}(U_{ij}) = V_i \\cap V_j\n\\text{ and }\ng_j|_{V_i \\cap V_j} = \\varphi_{ij} \\circ g_i|_{V_i \\cap V_j}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\} \\\\\ng & \\mapsto &\nV_i = g^{-1}(U_i), \\ g_i = \\varphi_i^{-1} \\circ g|_{V_i}\n\\end{eqnarray*}",
